{"data":[{"id":"wpser_8063be9ecbddf5cb92a38a1bcc","slug":"tears-on-a-withered-flower","title":"Tears on a Withered Flower","associatedNames":"دموع على زهرة ذابلة\nKareta Hana ni Namida wo\nLacrime su un fiore appassito\nLágrimas en una flor marchita\nLágrimas sobre flores murchas\nLệ Vương Trên Cánh Hoa Tàn\nNước Mắt Trên Đóa Hoa Tàn\nPleure pour cette fleur\nSideun Kkoch-e Nunmul-eul\nSolmuş Bir Çiçeğin Gözyaşları\nTears for the Withered Flower\nTränen auf einer welken Blume\nŁzy ze zwiędłych kwiatów\nСлёзы на увядшем цветке\nСлёзы по увядшему цветку\nบุปผารุ่มราคะ\n枯れた花に涙を\n枯萎之花上的眼泪\n枯萎的花淚\n시든 꽃에 눈물을","description":"خيانة مريرة، ديون متراكمة، وفقدان طفل.. هكذا انهارت حياة \"نا هاي-سو\" أمام زوج غادر. وبينما هي على حافة الهاوية، يظهر شاب غامض يطلب منها تعليم الحب الناضج! فهل يزهر الندى على قلبها المحطم؟ رحلة درامية ناضجة عن التعافي، الخيانة، والأمل المستحيل. اكتشف كيف تولد الروح من جديد في Tears on a Withered Flower.","descriptionHtml":null,"author":"Gae","translator":"Merry_89","status":"ongoing","type":"manhwa","format":null,"coverImage":"https://content.mangatuk.com/axis/covers/rmgjj5osjevpcrt8tp0ixk92.webp","isTraining":false,"commentsEnabled":true,"commentsVisible":true,"createdBy":"wpusr_76ff20e824896006450fe9119a","updatedBy":"Y78yvL2GAserdlV4khi0CfhPwBQTZrRT","viewCount":3306118,"coinValue":0,"bookmarkCount":10934,"ratingCount":192,"ratingAvg":"8.91","createdAt":"2025-04-17T11:51:53.000Z","deletedAt":null,"deletedBy":null,"updatedAt":"2026-10-25T13:48:54.549Z","chapterCount":125,"latestChapter":{"id":"pbc5nky0kt5fwbseyh8gy3nj","seriesId":"wpser_8063be9ecbddf5cb92a38a1bcc","number":123,"title":"","slug":"chapter-123","createdBy":"wpusr_76ff20e824896006450fe9119a","uploadedByUserId":"wpusr_76ff20e824896006450fe9119a","uploadedByTeamId":"wpteam_76ff20e824896006450fe9119a","uploadedByTeamName":"Merry_89","updatedBy":null,"viewCount":8958,"isAdult":false,"coinValue":100,"coinLockStartsAt":null,"coinLockEndsAt":"2026-10-18T09:40:00.000Z","createdAt":"2026-10-17T0