nI Can't Wait to Eat You\nHanatte Okenai Kankei\nNicht genug von dir\nNo Me Canso de Ti\nTu es à croquer\nแกล้งเธอมาเจอรัก\n只想让你坠落\n恨不得吃掉妳\n放っておけない関係\n难咽之隐\n못 잡아먹어서 안달\n못잡아먹어서 안달","description":"كان كل شيء مثاليًا بشكل ممل. حتى يوم واحد وهو في الثلاثين من عمره… انحرف “كيم تايجون” بشكل متهور عن الطريق. للقاء هان سو إيون، ابنة السائق الذي أودى بحياة والديه. “كيف بحق الجحيم دخلت إلى هذه الشركة كغريب؟” لقد أثار وقاحتها اشمئزازي، لذلك قررت أن أبقيها في الجوار وأعذبها،مثل شخص لا يستطيع الاكتفاء منك…","descriptionHtml":null,"author":"Bodoboe, Flada","translator":"Habiba ❤️","status":"completed","type":"manhwa","format":null,"coverImage":"https://content.mangatuk.com/axis/covers/sis5ah7d5wfi64fq9k5gtn2h.webp","isTraining":false,"commentsEnabled":true,"commentsVisible":true,"createdBy":"wpusr_c2738a418424a8cd87f3d7c180","updatedBy":"Y78yvL2GAserdlV4khi0CfhPwBQTZrRT","viewCount":1877676,"coinValue":0,"bookmarkCount":1025,"ratingCount":14,"ratingAvg":"9.00","createdAt":"2024-08-28T01:34:32.000Z","deletedAt":null,"deletedBy":null,"updatedAt":"2026-10-24T23:04:04.199Z","chapterCount":124,"latestChapter":{"id":"osvdvq9i3lsn3lbogi6m4781","seriesId":"wpser_665c00252ed7b4a32bd3d6cd37","number":123.5,"title":"","slug":"chapter-123.5","createdBy":"wpusr_c2738a418424a8cd87f3d7c180","uploadedByUserId":"wpusr_c2738a418424a8cd87f3d7c180","uploadedByTeamId":"wpteam_c2738a418424a8cd87f3d7c180","uploadedByTeamName":"Habiba ❤️","updatedBy":null,"viewCount":2397,"isAdult":false,"coinValue":0,"coinLockStartsAt":null,"coinLockEndsAt":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-07T19:21:09.438Z","publishedAt":"2026-05-07 19:21:09.438459","updatedAt":"2026-05-12T19:28:38.578Z","coinAccess":{"locked":false,"kind":"free","changesAt":null}},"hasAdultChapters":false,"recentChapters":[{"id":"osvdvq9i3lsn3lbogi6m4781","seriesId":"wpser_665c00252ed7b4a32bd3d6cd37","number":123.5,"title":"","slug":"chapter-123.5","createdBy":"wpusr_c2738a418424a8cd87f3d7c180","uploadedByUserId":"wpusr_c2738a418424a8cd87f3d7c180","uploadedB